-- Auto-generated by tools/balance/generate_plus3_mods.py.
--
-- Reforge +3 items that the BG-Wiki generator
-- (tools/gen_naked_item_stats.py) missed because they had pre-
-- existing token mods (job-specific JA bonuses) which made its
-- 'is naked' check treat them as already populated. Without
-- this file these items ship with ONLY their tokens and no
-- standard stat block.
--
-- Strategy: derive each +3 stats from its +2 sibling using the
-- PLUS3_STEP table (median delta across the user's 110 healthy
-- AF+3 vs AF+2 pairs).
--
-- Filename prefix 'zz_' ensures we load AFTER /sql/item_mods.sql
-- (which does DROP TABLE on every full update); INSERT IGNORE
-- preserves existing tokens AND any future BG-Wiki data — if
-- BG-Wiki ever populates one of these items, its row wins.
-- ============================================================

